  "content": "\n\n<p>此為位於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC\">https://github.com/CyclopsMC</a> 所列模組所需的程式庫模組。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>歡迎在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/9yDxubB\">Cyclops Discord 伺服器</a> 的 #cyclopscore 頻道與我們交流！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組允許您透過 XML 宣告自訂合成配方，更多資訊請參閱&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC/CyclopsCore/wiki/Recipe-XML\">維基頁面</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC/packages/packages/\">開發版本</a> 已托管於 GitHub Packages。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組會收集<a href=\"https://github.com/CyclopsMC/CyclopsCore/blob/master-1.9/src/main/java/org/cyclops/cyclopscore/tracking/Analytics.java\">匿名化啟動數據</a>，您可以在設定檔中關閉此功能，且其運作方式遵循 Minecraft 的資訊收集設定。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<center><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/cyclops\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/banner/console-affiliation-banners/banner_abd7c360-8f9d-4395-8382-b28f26a2d6b2.png\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\" /></a><br />使用優惠碼 <strong>cyclops</strong> 租用 <strong><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/cyclops\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a> 伺服器</strong> 即可支持我們，並享有 <strong>25% 折扣！</strong></center>\n<center><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kroeser\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Patreon_logo.svg/1082px-Patreon_logo.svg.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"36\" /></a><br />如果您喜歡這個模組，歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kroeser\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 支持我！</center>",
